1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,650
M: Mr. Venters has granted everyone in our department permission to attend the trade fair this Friday.

2
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:06,610
W: That's wonderful news.

3
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:12,410
I'll be out of town, so I can't make it, but I'm sure many people are eager to go.

4
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,120
M: That's right.

5
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:17,710
I already asked around, and seventeen people indicated they'll be going.

6
00:00:18,455 --> 00:00:20,250
I'll be registering everyone later today.

7
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:24,750
W: I don't think we've ever had that many people attend a professional event.

8
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:30,790
M: More people are focusing on networking these days, and trade fairs are some of the best places to do that.

9
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,440
W: I suppose you're right.

10
00:00:33,015 --> 00:00:35,710
In that case, it's a real shame I can't go.
